aragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195720/extras/b065dd46528682a150c87ab9ca5309d9.poster.avif?t=1738182476\" width=680 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195720/extras/b065dd46528682a150c87ab9ca5309d9.webm?t=1738182476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195720/extras/b065dd46528682a150c87ab9ca5309d9.mp4?t=1738182476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
